title: "S1A genome visualisation and regulator analysis"
abstract: >-
  Reproducible pipeline for the circular genome map, bacteriocin locus diagram
  and predicted transcription-factor family chart of the Lacticaseibacillus
  strain S1A draft genome, produced as a figure contribution to a study of
  probiotic-loaded hydrogels.
